140-See the [Voice](../../docs/agents/voice.md) reference.
141-
142-### State Management
143-
144-State persists across requests and syncs to all connected clients:
145-
146-```typescript
147-import { Agent, callable, type Connection } from "agents";
148-
149-type State = { items: string[] };
150-
151-export class MyAgent extends Agent<Env, State> {
152-  initialState: State = { items: [] };
153-
154-  @callable()
155-  addItem(item: string) {
156-    this.setState({ items: [...this.state.items, item] });
157-  }
158-
159-  onStateChanged(state: State, source: Connection | "server") {
160-    // Called after state is persisted and broadcast
161-  }
162-}
163-```
164-
165-### Callable Methods
166-
167-Expose methods to clients with the `@callable()` decorator:
168-
169-```typescript
170-@callable()
171-async processOrder(orderId: string, items: Item[]) {
172-  // Full type safety - clients call this like a local function
173-  const result = await this.validateAndProcess(orderId, items);
174-  return result;
175-}
176-```
177-
178-```typescript
179-// Client
180-const result = await agent.stub.processOrder("order-123", items);
181-```
182-
183-### Scheduling
184-
185-Run tasks later, on intervals, or with cron expressions:
186-
187-```typescript
188-// In 60 seconds
189-this.schedule(60, "sendReminder", { userId: "123" });
190-
191-// Every hour
192-this.scheduleEvery(3600, "syncData");
193-
194-// Daily at 9am UTC
195-this.schedule("0 9 * * *", "dailyReport");
